{"screen_name": "roda_desu", "file": "roda_desu-bbe7bb", "name": "roda Skeb", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1757755077245489152/COo-p7Vc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1411197049396076545/1772037886/1500x500", "description": "🔶💧/🐳が好きだぜ", "total_works": 13, "scraped_works": 13, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T17:09:50.792329+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T17:09:50.792329+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T17:09:50.792329+00:00"}], "novel": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T17:09:50.792329+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000, "novel": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}, "novel": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/roda_desu", "name": "roda_desu"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@roda_desu/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/23502425/uploads/origins/54a3b9cc-7bbb-4f13-b572-8e3981fcc1b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a071b6e94f9ceba8bc1c9366f76726a0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23502425/uploads/origins/54a3b9cc-7bbb-4f13-b572-8e3981fcc1b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a071b6e94f9ceba8bc1c9366f76726a0, https://si.imgix.net/23502425/uploads/origins/54a3b9cc-7bbb-4f13-b572-8e3981fcc1b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=696984456a298d49be4fd6e4f9c286b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23502425/uploads/origins/54a3b9cc-7bbb-4f13-b572-8e3981fcc1b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48b653254fcc80a1e42c288e0edf7f6b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello sensei!! It's nice to see you again. I would like to make a new request, since I loved the previous one.\n\n✨️ Characters\n[1] Quinn\nMale. 168cm.\nQuinn at first is not very kind, often cynical and critical of others while maintaining a sharp tongue. He keeps his walls up, and finds it hard to trust others. He pushes people away, finds it hard to care, but once he does care he is thoughtful and it is something he would find embarrassing. Cat-like. Smart. He is a healer / medic in most universes. Heterochromia eyes, one is lighter than the other. \n\nHealing + Resurrection magic. Tradeoff: loss of memory + physical corruption with each use. Scales to how much is healed or resurrected. He also likes flower pressing, and carries a journal to remember everything important to him.\n\n[2] Alphard\nMale. 170cm.\nAlphard appears like a guy who only cares for profit. He doesn't get close to anyone except for work and parts his ways with others whenever the job is done. He likes to prove himself and brag about his greatness, making him seem like a narcissistic show off. Despite that, he cares greatly about other people and tries to minimize damages and puts great efforts keeping the group together during jobs. He is usually seen in the \"default outfit\". He has one blue eye and one yellow eye and the lights in his eyes look like sparkles.\n\nInjuries transfer magic and healing magic. Alphard can only heal himself. In order to continue working as healer, he first transfers injuries to himself and then heals himself whenever he arrives at an inn.\n\n✨️ Relationship\nThey are a couple, though at first, they didn't like each other. They love to playfully argue, but they also take good care of each other. Due to their similarities, they often feel like they are the only ones who are able to understand one another. They have both kept their distance from other people for so long, and as a result they do not know how to handle their emotions well, at times being shy around each other.\n\n✨️Request\nI love the atmosphere in these requests:\nhttps://skeb.jp/@roda_desu/works/10\nhttps://skeb.jp/@roda_desu/works/3\n\nIf possible, I would love to see sensei draw them under a starry night sky.\n\n✨️References \nhttps://peapup.notion.site/quinoa-26a8ee95900280d99005cd1403e53953\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roda_desu/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/31dafd43/uploads/origins/d7f2bdc7-45d5-4164-8676-2aa557606c28?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4db9a2c2a538da5d861a1fd2995676d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31dafd43/uploads/origins/d7f2bdc7-45d5-4164-8676-2aa557606c28?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4db9a2c2a538da5d861a1fd2995676d9, https://si.imgix.net/31dafd43/uploads/origins/d7f2bdc7-45d5-4164-8676-2aa557606c28?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9373452b65bbfb9fac5cc1dfed103d41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31dafd43/uploads/origins/d7f2bdc7-45d5-4164-8676-2aa557606c28?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3dad48cbe2b057861d400a6f8473317e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roda_desu/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f6ced96/uploads/origins/c6b695b7-9fa2-4b40-807a-131cec709c94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3006a4ccb96e8409fbb671752215aa29", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f6ced96/uploads/origins/c6b695b7-9fa2-4b40-807a-131cec709c94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3006a4ccb96e8409fbb671752215aa29, https://si.imgix.net/6f6ced96/uploads/origins/c6b695b7-9fa2-4b40-807a-131cec709c94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a93fc846cff2c927949739609376a17 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f6ced96/uploads/origins/c6b695b7-9fa2-4b40-807a-131cec709c94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3189e5bd70d0b15dd213f06046d4475 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、roda先生。先生のイラストと粽がとても気に入っています！\nモラックスとイビルアイの鍾馗イラストが欲しいので、より良いものを作っていただくために、他は何でも構いませんのでよろしくお願いします。\n他の中二好きな人に送る資料にも使いたいです。\nお返事お待ちしています！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roda_desu/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/031bb550/uploads/origins/ed79da3e-7d49-4c7f-aed9-0f5eeb6e503c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ac4f62c727c89982fc3941579bd2ea4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/031bb550/uploads/origins/ed79da3e-7d49-4c7f-aed9-0f5eeb6e503c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ac4f62c727c89982fc3941579bd2ea4, https://si.imgix.net/031bb550/uploads/origins/ed79da3e-7d49-4c7f-aed9-0f5eeb6e503c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63395ddb8385fed8433b8f6a21016ab5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/031bb550/uploads/origins/ed79da3e-7d49-4c7f-aed9-0f5eeb6e503c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=075c98ba04166a7cb34268eabe67b0db 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！友人のキャラクター、ソトとハルをリクエストしたいと思っていました。\n\nharuは物腰が柔らかくて内気で、いつも時間を見つけては人を助けています！\n\nsotoは短気で、自分の中に閉じこもりがちです。外見は乱暴ですが、内面は愛する人をとても大切に思っています。\n\n二人ともお互いを大切にしており、とても愛情深く、ラブラブで、離れられない。\n\nロマンチックな雰囲気で描いてください！構図は自由です！\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1VnDY72rwo7lXtoz-UWfK7eJTUDWqVCuq?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roda_desu/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bba4077e/uploads/origins/532453a3-7e32-483a-b772-5875a33eff6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12855dc47254607b94752c99ff4960ef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bba4077e/uploads/origins/532453a3-7e32-483a-b772-5875a33eff6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12855dc47254607b94752c99ff4960ef, https://si.imgix.net/bba4077e/uploads/origins/532453a3-7e32-483a-b772-5875a33eff6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba91da79e40bd54af5273af10bbf6c69 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bba4077e/uploads/origins/532453a3-7e32-483a-b772-5875a33eff6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edbad0e17fe70f8b7356699dad30b7fe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "rodaさん、はじめまして！\nrodaさんの絵はとても生き生きとしていて可愛らしく、見ていて微笑ましくなりますね！\n2キャラお願いしてもいいですか？\n\n✨️Jonas\n26歳 // 男性 // 190cm\n- 感情を表に出さず、ストイックに振る舞うが、人のことをとても大切に思っている。いつもは少し悲しげな表情をしているが、ニャンズといるときは笑顔が増える。\n\n✨️ ニャンス\n- 26歳 // 男性 // 180cm\n- 一見無邪気だが、いざとなると狡猾になり、仕事以外でもわざと人を苛立たせるために大げさに反応する傾向がある。\n\n✨️Request\n1枚目の画像にあるカップルアートがとても気に入りました：\nhttps://twitter.com/roda_desu/status/1629096679373959168\n私たちのキャラクターにも同じようなやり取りを描いていただけませんか？\n\n✨️参考文献\nhttps://sta.sh/211jl1bq3lja?edit=1 (このリンクに彼らのリファレンスシートと詳細があります)\nhttps://toyhou.se/21373543.jonas/gallery?key=KIuDjAZtA8ubkjd (ここで彼らのインタラクションを見つけることができます)\n\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@roda_desu/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8ab1a7c4/uploads/origins/3acb0ce4-3951-44fe-8433-9658b267e7fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ede5bf7c8b5156e7026e4a277fc67681", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8ab1a7c4/uploads/origins/3acb0ce4-3951-44fe-8433-9658b267e7fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ede5bf7c8b5156e7026e4a277fc67681, https://si.imgix.net/8ab1a7c4/uploads/origins/3acb0ce4-3951-44fe-8433-9658b267e7fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9af2b75b9ce9596c2d6152eb8fd3f475 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8ab1a7c4/uplo